catalogue tclldoc
shortdesc Doc/docstrip for tcl
relocated 1
longdesc The tclldoc package and class simplify the application of the
longdesc doc/docstrip style of literate programming with Dr. John
longdesc Ousterhout's Tool Command Language (Tcl, pronounced "tickle",
longdesc a.k.a. The Cool Language). The tclldoc package is a bit like
longdesc the doc package is for LaTeX, whereas the tclldoc class more
longdesc parallels the ltxdoc class.
runfiles size=9
